negative sign), so that its concurrence |hψ|ψ̃i| is equal to 1. At the other
extreme, an unentangled, or factorizable, pure state such as | ↑↓i is always
mapped by the spin flip transformation into an orthogonal state, so that its
concurrence is zero. Later we will use another fact about E(C), namely, that
it is a convex function (that is, curving upward).
